\cf0 \
Prov_Zh-Py-Text: list of the provinces with their Chinese and pinyin names and a ProvTextual column that can be used to join data for the Province_Textual field in MCBD.\
\
Prov_Name_ID_All: list of all recorded province names in modern China with their name in Chine, pinyin and historically recorded transliterated names, and code designation (for PRC provinces. The code has been extended to attribute a code number to historical provinces). To be used for joining with data from historical sources to attribute the current standard name of provinces.\
\
Province_Timeline: basic timeline of provinces, both past and present, in modern China.\
\
Provincial_Capitals files: list of the names of the provincial capital for each period between 1912 and today, with the name of the province and the geocoordinates of the capitals.\
\
Prov_Capitals_PRC: list of the names of the provincial capital in the PRC, with the name of the province and the geocoordinates of the capitals.\
\
Province_RPC: list of the provinces and special municipalities in the PRC and their status}